    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span><span class=\"time\">25 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip warn\">Medium</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Parsing</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Overflow guard</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/string-to-integer-atoi/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 8</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>String to Integer (atoi)</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">One left-to-right pass through four phases: skip spaces, read one optional sign, fold digits into value = value·10 + d, stop at the first non-digit. Check value &gt; (INT_MAX - d) / 10 <b>before</b> each fold and clamp, so the accumulator never overflows. O(n) time, O(1) space.</p>\n"
